Package: nddev-systeminfo
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: NDDev OpenNetwork <danil@nddev.it.com>
Depends: init-system-helpers (>= 1.66), @SHLIBS@
Breaks: rldyour-sysinfo (<< 0.3.2)
Replaces: rldyour-sysinfo (<< 0.3.2)
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Native standalone system information
 Publishes CPU, memory, GPU, temperature, disk, and network readings as
 newline-delimited JSON over a per-user Unix socket. A systemd user socket
 unit is enabled for all sessions, so the daemon runs only while a client is
 attached. Includes the CLI and native GNOME interface; NDS is optional.
